      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We have briefly summarized only the data obtained in our own laboratory without including an extensive literature review. We have evaluated the changes in platelet membrane phospholipids and prostanoid formation in platelets. In atherosclerosis platelets show an activated prostanoid formation, whereas the plasma PGI2 levels are decreased."},
